# Convoy's own first-run writes these into every seat worktree (CANON:
# ensure_first_run installs neuron-identity into .grok/skills, .claude/skills
# and an AGENTS.md pointer). This repo is itself a seat worktree for the agents
# building it, so here they are generated artifacts, not repo content.
# If a curated AGENTS.md is ever wanted, `git add -f` it.
.claude/
.grok/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Per-seat thread pointer / handoff layer written into a checkout.
.ola/
thread.md

# Per-session operator notes (seed / handoff prompts). Machine-specific paths,
# never repo content.
SEED.md
PRIOR_THREAD.md

# Conductor/neuron message drops that live untracked in a seat checkout.
CHIP.md
CONDUCTOR*.md
CONFIRM.md
GREEN.md
LATENCY.md
LIVE_SEAT_SPEC.md
ORCH_SEND.md
PUSH.md
STAMP.md
ULTRACODE.md
